      "writtenOn": "2026-07-28T08:30:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "About question 1:\nThe initial state currently relies on the systemd service ordering.\nneard is configured to start after FruDevice, so FruDevice registers the D-Bus match before neard creates the TAG interfaces. \nUnder the intended boot sequence, the InterfacesAdded signals should be received for tag.\n\nAbout question 2:\nFor interface removal, the current implementation does not yet handle InterfacesRemoved from org.neard. \nI will add an InterfacesRemoved match and remove the corresponding FruDevice object when the NFC TAG is removed to avoid leaving stale D-Bus objects.",
      "parentUuid": "a3e3e724_a6a40ab4",
      "revId": "46d6e5535241f8008852aa1fa038ebab9c58b8c3",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
